twodrive (0.2.15-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Serialize metadata updates across Database clones to prevent same-instance
    writers exhausting SQLite lock waits under shared storage contention.
  * Preserve read concurrency, SQLite timeout, database schema and recovery data.
  * Add failure-release and controlled slow-sync regressions, and repeat native
    Windows database tests at higher concurrency.
  * Keep standard offline Debian source/binary builds and desktop integration.

