twodrive (0.2.14-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Migrate stable packaging to dpkg-buildpackage and debhelper.
  * Generate ELF/Python dependencies, manuals, conffiles and debug symbols.
  * Include locked dependency sources for offline source-package rebuilds.
  * Preserve the 0.2.14 engine, desktop integration and user data.
  * Link distribution SQLite with generated runtime version dependencies.
  * Keep service activation opt-in and add package/upgrade regression checks.

